 "limits": "Timestamps without an offset are taken as written, so a table mixing local and UTC times needs one convention first; daylight saving changes are not applied. Requests closed before they were opened are counted and left out. Durations count calendar hours, not business hours. Resolution speed is not satisfaction: indicator 16.6.2 is a survey of people's experience.",
